00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:39.310
That was by the way, 27 years ago.

00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:40.340
How much fun?

00:08:40.340 --> 00:08:42.110
No such thing as reality TV.

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:44.900
I would do it again
tomorrow, I had so much fun.

00:08:44.900 --> 00:08:46.600
