recently, so how did that go?

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:05.500
Was it fun or terrifying?
- First of all, there he is.

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:08.160
So Crowley Sullivan, my
husband, he was so funny, y'all,

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:10.070
because I've been on
this show for 12 years,

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:12.040
we talked about this,
to get hired at age 40

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:13.300
and I'll be 52 this year.

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:14.730
- Yeah.
- So he sits down

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:16.560
and he's like, "Oh, so this
is what you've been doing

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:17.393
