00:09:17.393 --> 00:09:18.786
Like nobody in my family cares.

00:09:18.786 --> 00:09:20.080
- They don't watch?
- They don't watch,

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:22.286
they don't know what I
do, you know what I mean?

00:09:22.286 --> 00:09:23.210
That's kinda nice.

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:25.218
- I love it.
- Yeah, 'cause then you just

00:09:25.218 --> 00:09:26.190
have a family home.
- We've made sure the kids

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:28.430
are the stars, it's all about them.

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:30.650
And I remember once I was
covering the Golden Globes

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:32.920
